<XDFFORMAT version="1.70">
<XDFHEADER>
  <deftitle>06A906032S</deftitle>
  <description>ASAP2 DAM 221DZ04T. File offsets are ECU addresses minus 0x800000. A 16-bit axis or body that would start on an odd byte is stored at the next even byte. On a map, the DAM's first axis is the table row. The DAM dataset is F21dz/Dst00 dated 03.08.1999. The paired hex is 06A906032S software 0004, EPK F21dz/Dst04t dated 27.08.1999.</description>
</XDFHEADER>
